  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Waanjoñak code, JSON Schema ko, im template ko an policy machine-readable rej pād iuṃwin MIT License ijellọkin ñe ewor kōjjeḷā oktak. Kwōmaroñ deploy er ioon site ko aṃ make ejjeḷọk kōṇaan wōṇāān.",
