  "Commercial use requires contact": "Kōjerbal commercial ej aikuj contact",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Kar jiroñ e ālikin Bletchley AI Safety Summit eo, Yoshua Bengio ej tōl e, im 100 jān eḷap in expert rej jipañ jān enañin 30 aelōñ kobaik ippān UN, OECD im EU, report in ej make wōt ej koba kōj scientific evidence ko rainin kōn capability im risk ko an AI e frontier — im ej kwaḷọk bwe jet system kiiō remaroñ jeḷā ñe rej kar joñe im ukot aer behavior ekkar.",
