  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Positioning eo jiṃwe: research draft ko rej make wōt, protocol proposal ko, im juon experiment in specification open.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Kar kōkāāl juon default ṃokta: Belgium (BE) kiiō ej map ñan Dutch jab French — ri-kōnono Flemish rej eḷap iaan ro ilo aelōñ eo (~60%) jān ri-kōnono French Walloon (~40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Kar kōkāāl juon default ṃokta: Kazakhstan (KZ) kiiō ej map ñan Kazakh jab Russian, kiiō ke ewor translation ilo Kazakh — ejja wōt kain kōkāāl āinwōt eo ṃokta ñan Belgium.",
