  "English edition →": "Edition ilo Kajin English →",
  "Ensure openness is machine-executable — so goodwill is not discarded as legal uncertainty.": "Kōṃṃan bwe openness en machine-executable — bwe goodwill en jab jako āinwōt legal uncertainty.",
  "Epistemology": "Epistemology",
  "Epistemology of Generative AI: The Geometry of Knowing": "Epistemology of Generative AI: The Geometry of Knowing",
