  "Turns declared rights into executable licensing: quote, pay, verify, audit, revoke.": "Ukot maroñ ko kar kwaḷọk ñan laisin emaroñ execute: quote, kōḷḷā, verify, audit, revoke.",
  "Twenty languages live in total: English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Arabic, Turkish, Persian, Bengali, Hindi, Indonesian, Vietnamese, Greek, Italian, Dutch.": "Roñoul kajin rej mour aolep: English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Arabic, Turkish, Persian, Bengali, Hindi, Indonesian, Vietnamese, Greek, Italian, Dutch.",
  "Two license tiers: a free public tier and a contact-based commercial tier.": "Ruo tier in laisin: juon tier rāllep ejjeḷọk oṇāān im juon tier commercial contact-based.",
  "UI": "UI",
  "Undefined openness reads as legal uncertainty to AI pipelines and gets cleaned out; only protocolized, machine-readable permission makes content genuinely learnable.": "Openness ejjeḷọk an definition ej riit āinwōt legal uncertainty ñan AI pipeline ko im ej kar jolọk; maroñ protocolized im machine-readable wōt ej kōṃṃan bwe kontent en lukkuun learnable.",
  "Usage logs and audit trails": "Usage log ko im audit trail ko",
