  "Verified in both LTR and RTL contexts: the panel mirrors correctly for Arabic and Persian without any special-casing, using logical CSS positioning.": "Kar verify ilo LTR im RTL context otemjej: panel eo ej mirror jiṃwe ñan Arabic im Persian ejjeḷọk special-casing, kōn logical CSS positioning.",
  "Verify": "Verify",
