  "Versioned specifications, JSON Schemas, and the policy files actually deployed on this site. Every file can be downloaded, validated, and cited directly.": "Specification ko ewor version, JSON Schema ko, im file ko in policy lukkuun kar deploy ioon site in. File otemjej emaroñ download, validate, im cite directly.",
  "Versioning": "Versioning",
