  "versioned, citable, traceable": "ewor version, emaroñ cite, emaroñ track",
  "“AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” now published in English as the canonical edition; the Chinese original manuscript remains available and both versions cross-link.": "“AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” kiiō kar publish ilo English āinwōt canonical edition; manuscript eo ṃokta ilo Chinese ej pād wōt im version ko ruo rej cross-link.",
  "“Protocolized Openness” confirmed as an English-language paper (with Chinese parallel passages) — no separate translation planned.": "“Protocolized Openness” kar kaṃool āinwōt juon paper ilo kajin English (ippān passage ko parallel ilo Chinese) — ejjeḷọk translation make kar planned.",
